[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0010","text":"啊……伞……\n破了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0020","text":"哎，没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0030","text":"抱歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0040","text":"……——我说雾子\n如果是布料破了的话，还是能修的哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0050","text":"有店家可以帮忙修，\n买修理用的贴片的话自己也能搞定"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0060","text":"…………\n这样……啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0070","text":"那……我想……\n自己修好它……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0080","text":"OK！\n那待会儿在网上找找看有没有合适的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0090","text":"——那么，爱惜雨伞的雾子小姐\n回事务所的路上要不要用三峰的伞？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800400_01_0100","text":"嗯……！\n谢谢你……结华酱……"}]
